    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean, i've read online that some people on these meds can eat a bit of stuff as long as they don't go crazy with it. id rather not change my whole lifestyle if i dont have to. if i just stick to the standard serving sizes, like a tablespoon of soy sauce or a slice of cheese, is that actually going to cause a crisis? it seems like a lot of work to avoid everything when i just want to eat normally.",
